    "tpb_book": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>1. 上課使用自編講義</div>\n\n<div>2. 另外可參考閱讀教材：</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>2.1 Analog Integrated Circuit Design-David A Johns &amp; Ken Martin</div>\n\n<div>2.2. CMOS Analog Circuit Design-Phillip E. Allen &amp; Douglas R. Holberg</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
